# Camera App (OpenCV)

## Overview
This project captures video from a webcam using OpenCV, displays a live feed, and logs frame information such as resolution, timestamp, and FPS.

## Features
- Webcam video capture
- Real-time display using OpenCV
- Frame logging (resolution, FPS, timestamp)
- Modular C++ class design (`Camera` class)

## Project Structure
cam_sample/
├── include/
│ └── Camera.h
├── src/
│ ├── main.cpp
│ └── Camera.cpp
├── doc/
├── CMakeLists.txt
└── README.md

## Dependencies

Install required packages 
openCV

## Build 
cd cam_sample
mkdir build
cd build
cmake ..
cmake --build .

## Run Instruction 
./camera_app
